@startuml frontend
title Frontend - OpenUI5 Webapp
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

actor User
component "Component.js\nUI5 bootstrap and router" as component
component "Views\n\n- App.view.xml\n- Discussion.view.xml\n- Personas.view.xml\n- Settings.view.xml" as views
component "Controllers\n\n- Discussion.controller.js\n- Personas.controller.js\n- Settings.controller.js" as controllers
component "Models\n\n- AppModel.js\n- ConfigurationModel.js\n- ui JSONModel" as models
component "ApiService.js\nfetch client" as apiService
component "i18n ResourceModel" as i18n
cloud "Backend API" as backend

User --> views : uses
component --> views : routes
views --> controllers : events and bindings
controllers <--> models : state
views --> i18n : labels
models --> apiService : requests
apiService --> backend : HTTP /api

note right of views
The views represent the user-facing
screens of the application.
end note

note right of models
Models separate UI state,
configuration and API data.
end note
@enduml
